      "contextBefore": "Use this method when you want to format a single URL value with a specific format style, or call it repeatedly with different format styles.",
      "contextAfter": "```swift\nlet url = URL(string:\"https://www.example.com:8080/path/to/endpoint?key=value\")!\nlet formatted = url.formatted(.url\n    .scheme(.never)\n    .host(.always)\n    .port(.never)\n    .path(.always)\n    .query(.never)) // \"www.example.com/path/to/endpoint\"\n\n```",
      "documentTitle": "formatted(:)",
